WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
<v Paolo>Good morning everyone. So, starting with
delivery: the truck should have arrived</v>

00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:07.540
<v Paolo>Tuesday, but the supplier
says it slips Thursday.</v>

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:09.540
<v Speaker 2>Thursday morning or afternoon?</v>

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:11.940
<v Paolo>Morning, before ten please.</v>

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:16.900
<v Élodie>OK, but the price stays as
agreed in the March order, right?</v>

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:16.000
<v Speaker 2>Yes, yes.</v>

00:00:16.960 --> 00:00:19.210
<v Élodie>Because we cannot reopen
the negotiations now.</v>

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:23.220
<v Paolo>Good, we will talk after delivery.</v>

01:01:40.000 --> 01:01:42.820
<v Speaker 2>Summary: delivery Thursday before
ten sharp, price unchanged.</v>

01:01:46.000 --> 01:01:47.620
<v Paolo>Perfect, thanks to everyone!</v>
